    "God": {
      "Catechism": {
        "Introduction": {
          "The Deist Catechism is an accessible summary of Deist thought": {},
          "It serves children and adults, instructing them in what is right, and insulating them from what is wrong": {},
          "The Deist Catechism exists to edify the intellect, inspire ethical living, and cultivate a sense of awe and wonder towards the universe.": {}
        },
        "Catechism": {
          "What is the chief end of humankind?<br>": {},
          "The chief end of humankind is to find God<br>": {},
          "Hasn't God been found already in the form of Yahweh, Jesus, and Allah?<br>": {},
          "No, as these are false Gods": {},
          "No one has ever heard, nor seen them<br>": {},
          "Where is God?<br>": {},
          "God is outside of this universe<br>": {},
          "Can you see God?<br>": {},
          "Not at this time<br>": {},
          "Does God hear our prayers?<br>": {},
          "No. God does not hear us<br>": {},
          "Should you glorify God?<br>": {},
          "Sure, if you would like<br>": {},
          "Who were our first parents?<br>": {},
          "Chromosomal Adam and Eve, from Africa<br>": {},
          "Of what were our first parents made?<br>": {},
          "They were the continuation of an earlier, similar species<br>": {},
          "What is a covenant?<br>": {},
          "An agreement between two or more persons.<br>": {},
          "How many Gods are there?<br>": {},
          "One. The Creator God<br>": {},
          "Does God know all things?<br>": {},
          "No<br>": {},
          "Who wrote the Bible?<br>": {},
          "Ordinary people<br>": {},
          "Should I live my life according to the first two testaments?<br>": {},
          "No, as they are legacy. A better life doctrine is the Third Testament, which has superseded the first two<br>": {},
          "What is the purpose of religion?<br>": {},
          "The purpose of religion is to empower the people socially<br>": {},
          "Am I not then equally served by attending a traditional house of worship?<br>": {},
          "If you appreciate traditional doctrine, this is the better path for you<br>": {},
          "What is the Beatific Vision?<br>": {},
          "The Beatific Vision will occur when humankind unequivocally witnesses the face of God<br>": {},
          "How will we know this event has occurred?<br>": {},
          "You will investigate the claims scientifically<br>": {},
          "What is the Ascension?<br>": {},
          "The Ascension is the period after the Beatific Vision in which we become communicant with God<br>": {}
        }
      },
      "Central Topology": {
        "God is outside of the Cosmos, in Heaven": {},
        "The Cosmos, as God's creation, are also contained within Heaven": {},
        "The Children of Abraham presently occupy only a small part of the Cosmos": {},
        "Cosmological Topology": {
          "Heaven": {
